"""
DecodeLabs Project 3 - Phishing Awareness Analyzer
A heuristic-based triage tool that scans pasted email/message text
(headers + body) for known phishing red flags and returns a
Safe / Suspicious / Malicious verdict following a Pause-Verify-Report
decision tree.

This is a TEXT-PATTERN / HEURISTIC simulation tool. It does NOT connect
to live mail servers, DNS, or threat-intel APIs - it evaluates whatever
sample text the analyst pastes in, exactly like a manual SOC triage
exercise.
"""

